        "title": "Arlopu Recalls Slide Playsets Due to Risk of Serious Injury and Death from Head and Neck Entrapment Hazards",
        "fact_zh": "CPSC 发布与运动或户外产品相关的召回：Arlopu Recalls Slide Playsets Due to Risk of Serious Injury and Death from Head and Neck Entrapment Hazards",
        "impact_zh": "若经营同类产品，建议核对品牌、型号、ASIN 和在库批次，并检查供应商测试资料及停售/召回要求。主要风险：The recalled products contain multiple openings where a child’s torso can fit through the opening, but a child’s head cannot, posing a risk of serious injury and death due to head and neck entrapment hazards. Additionally, the basketball nets on the recalled products with model number KT-CS17 can come unhooked from the rim, forming a loop large enough for a child’s head, posing entanglement and strangulation hazards.。",
        "impact_is_inference": true,
        "url": "https://cpsc.gov/Recalls/2027/Arlopu-Recalls-Slide-Playsets-Due-to-Risk-of-Serious-Injury-and-Death-from-Head-and-Neck-Entrapment-Hazards",
